    "title": "Eugenia Last, what's my daily horoscope today? Sagittarius, bide your time (12/11/25) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eugenia Last ,\n1 hours ago CELEBRITIES BORN ON THIS DAY: Mo’Nique, 58; Gary Dourdan, 59; Jermaine Jackson, 71; Bess Armstrong, 72. Happy Birthday: Be resourceful, choose your path and build momentum. Struggle, determination and fortitude will lead to positive change this year. Educate yourself in areas you feel a kinship to, and the motivation that sets in will help you reach and surpass your destination. Be true to yourself, but observant of others. Incorporate what you see and learn into what you are trying to achieve, and press forward with courage. Your numbers are 8, 13, 24, 27, 33, 38, 42. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
